FASTVC-BENCH-CORPUS:chromium-main-v1-943b94ae-1c74-4335-94fa-ceb4d277cea8
How to build:

  1. If you are building from cloned Git repository, make sure to update the
     submodules as well:

     $ git submodule init
     $ git submodule update

     Then run autoreconf

     $ autoreconf -if

  2. Build OTS

     $ ./configure
     $ make

  3. Run the tests (if you wish)

     $ make check
